sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Frontend as React frontend
  participant S3 as S3 media bucket
  participant Ingest as media_ingest_v2
  participant WIF as GCP WIF / IAM
  participant HMAC as HMAC secret
  participant CloudRun as Cloud Run /process-media
  participant Models as S3 models
  participant Result as process_ml_result_v2
  participant DDB as DynamoDB media table
  participant Query as Query/read APIs

  User->>Frontend: Select image or video for v2 path
  Frontend->>S3: Upload object to images-v2/ or videos-v2/
  S3-->>Ingest: Manual invoke today with S3 event shape
  Note over S3,Ingest: Future option: S3 ObjectCreated notification for v2 prefixes
  Ingest->>S3: head_object and read metadata
  Ingest->>S3: Read media bytes for thumbnail
  Ingest->>S3: Upload thumbnail
  Ingest->>S3: Generate presigned media input_url
  Ingest->>Models: Generate presigned model_urls for model.pt and mdv5a.pt
  Ingest->>WIF: Mint Google ID token for Cloud Run audience
  Ingest->>HMAC: Load shared secret and sign canonical body
  Ingest->>CloudRun: POST /process-media with ID token, X-Timestamp, X-Signature
  CloudRun->>CloudRun: Verify Cloud Run IAM and HMAC
  CloudRun->>S3: Download media using input_url
  CloudRun->>Models: Download/cache models by model_version

  alt Image
    CloudRun->>CloudRun: Run image inference
    CloudRun-->>Ingest: 200 {request_id, tag_counts}
  else Video
    CloudRun->>CloudRun: Sample 1 frame/sec by default
    CloudRun->>CloudRun: Apply optional sample_every_n_frames or max_frame if supplied
    CloudRun->>CloudRun: Merge top-level tag_counts as max count per species
    CloudRun-->>Ingest: 200 {request_id, tag_counts, frames[]}
  end

  Ingest->>Result: Invoke with owner/checksum/key/thumbnail and gcp_result
  Result->>Result: Treat missing status as ok
  Result->>Result: Normalize top-level tag_counts into tags
  Result->>DDB: Update media record upload_status=ready
  Query->>DDB: Read ready media record
  Query-->>Frontend: Return ready record with tags and presigned media URLs
